WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.370
Is two quarters more than one half?

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:05.880
Cut each piece neatly in two.

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:09.460
Now there are 4 pieces, and you have 2 of them.

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:13.930
Cut again: 8 pieces, 4 shaded.

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:21.013
More pieces, but smaller pieces. The shaded amount never changed at all.
